"Are we getting a good look?" she coached. "Is everyone paying attention?"
Keiler CEO and President Lynn Taylor brought three of her six dogs to work Friday, Sweetness, a foxhound mix from a Virginia shelter, and two German short-haired pointers, Keeney and Pippin the Wonderdog.
